{title: 014 - Let Us Praise the Name of the Lord}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #014 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 14}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Let [Em]us [Am]praise [Em]the name [G7/F]of [Em/G]the [C]Lord!
[F]Give Him [Em]glory, [C]Amen.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]Go [Em/G]ye [Am]into all [Em]the [C]world.
[F]Alleluia, [C]Amen.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Amen, [Em]amen,
[F]Amen, [C]amen.
{end_of_verse}
